            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Staphylococcus succinus subsp. succinus Type Strain DSM 14617, Isolated from Plant and Soil Inclusions within 25- to 35-Million-Year-Old Dominican Amber.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01521-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01521-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Staphylococcus succinus subsp. succinus type strain DSM 14617 was isolated from plant and soil inclusions within 25- to 35-million-year-old Dominican amber. The complete genome sequence of strain DSM 14617T includes a genome of 2.88 Mb (32.94% G+C content) without any plasmids.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Zhou et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
